From: Arena Agent <agent@arena.ai>
Date: Thu, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] AERA: minuitwrp: probe X6886 sysfs haptics

X6886 exposes regulator-vibrator brightness, vibrator duration/activate,
or vibrator_single duration/activate instead of timed_output. Probe those
LED interfaces before the optional force-feedback/HAL paths, pulse
brightness off the UI thread, and report availability to the native AERA
settings backend.

This is the AERA counterpart of the device TWRP haptics patch; AERA uses
minuitwrp/events.cpp and has no twrpminui force_feedback helper.

diff --git a/aeraui/platform/aera_backend.cpp b/aeraui/platform/aera_backend.cpp
index 91888fc..f4ece40 100644
--- a/aeraui/platform/aera_backend.cpp
+++ b/aeraui/platform/aera_backend.cpp
@@ -58,6 +58,7 @@
